307 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 254 0 R
/E (Located in the heart of Vancouver, BC, Boardwalk Broadway is the go-to destination for skaters and streetwear enthusiasts. Specializing in cutting-edge skater clothing, Boardwalk Boutique offers a diverse range of apparel and accessories that blend style, durability, and the latest trends. From graphic tees and hoodies to rugged jeans and snapbacks, our collection is curated to cater to the unique tastes of the skateboarding community.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
308 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 254 0 R
/E (In addition to our extensive clothing line, Boardwalk Broadway also rents out high-quality skateboards, ensuring both beginners and seasoned skaters have access to top-tier equipment. Whether you're looking to upgrade your wardrobe, find the perfect gift, or rent a board for a day at the park, our knowledgeable and friendly staff are here to help you every step of the way. Join us at Boardwalk Boutique and experience the ultimate skate culture right in Vancouver's vibrant downtown area.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
